ants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Mediterranean, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lNXAV6t34fqAdGa3MrDxkg","review_id":"ji1WY3Dw1ScNPDqaUY0ETA","date":"2021-02-25T04:12:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9386211037635803,"text_excerpt":"I went for hookah, but once I saw the menu I had to order the paella. The paella was a decent size serving, enough for 2 people... lots of seafood (calamari, shrimp, crawfish, scallops, mussels) but it was very salty and it had a very strong seafood flavor and smell (very off putting). I took the leftovers home and my house smelled like seafood for 2 days. The menu is very diverse and there are so many choices. I also like that the menu listed recommended wine pair for the entrees. The Cocktails were good as well. I ordered a Lychee-tini and I was impressed, not too sweet! Hookah was great, we didn't added ice or milk. The hookah was strong but not overpowering. The restaurant offered pro..."},{"business_id":"lNXAV6t34fqAdGa3MrDxkg","review_id":"N9W9XDCOOYIKsZWnnaAWZg","date":"2018-07-25T23:56:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385266304016113,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. Even though it's in the quarter, I will brave the traffic and people and cluster of everything to dine here. Went here for my birthday dinner with a few friends. We started with the hookah. It was good. They use in-house shisha, if I remember correctly; not Starbuzz. For dinner, we all ordered different things. The Kibby - AMAZE-ING!!! I had the chicken shawarma and it was delightful. Everyone loved their food, and we loved the atmosphere. The service was great, the shisha was there, and pro tip: go before dinner and enjoy a little quiet. After dinner, of course, I had to have Baklava and Turkish Coffee. Ohh, I wish they were in my neighborhood, because I would be there..."},{"business_id":"lNXAV6t34fqAdGa3MrDxkg","review_id":"kB9aH44Aqk-KimnuT9p7PA","date":"2016-04-27T20:06:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9315028190612793,"text_excerpt":"Yes! We loved Attiki during our most recent trip to Nola. Tucked away in the quarter we enjoyed some delish salads, spreads, and sandwiches. This was such a nice break from all the cream based seafood we'd been having elsewhere. Our server seemed a little frantic at first, perhaps a little understaffed, but she pulled it together and served us flawlessly. We split a few bottles of wine and just relaxed for a couple hours off the bourbon strip. After our meal we stayed and smoked hookah for about 30 minutes and just had a pleasant evening all around. If you're on the hunt for something other than \"creole/ Cajun\" in the quarter then definitely swing by Attiki!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lNXAV6t34fqAdGa3MrDxkg","photo_id":"_WFXFcoZgKVRYNk2LHVA8w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_WFXFcoZgKVRYNk2LHVA8w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9433143734931946},{"business_id":"lNXAV6t34fqAdGa3MrDxkg","photo_id":"rRQ1hXqnTVDHZx5LtJVPYw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rRQ1hXqnTVDHZx5LtJVPYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8702334761619568},{"business_id":"lNXAV6t34fqAdGa3MrDxkg","photo_id":"7-kTvZaWxRDt01wlTrsWiw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7-kTvZaWxRDt01wlTrsWiw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8494227528572083},{"business_id":"lNXAV6t34fqAdGa3MrDxkg","photo_id":"B9NJRASJXSbJF0OSTYPLWw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/B9NJRASJXSbJF0OSTYPLWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8256449699401855},{"business_id":"lNXAV6t34fqAdGa3MrDxkg","photo_id":"CS-1BgMeUOzYFsV2szhHlg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CS-1BgMeUOzYFsV2szhHlg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7847749590873718}]},"notebook_case":null}
